00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.940
Shall we get going?

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.240
Yes.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.830
We're leaving.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:00.580
Where?

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.790
Isn't it obvious? To get revenge!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.830
Why?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.080
