00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.130
Why?

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.430
Hey, Uncle! Look after her for us!

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:19.350
What?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.010
Giuvigiuvio...

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.310
I swear...

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:24.980
I'm going to kick your butt!

